# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
CAT_AX="Which job does the fixture do for the house: kitchen work, washing and wellness, living comfort, the shell and ways through it, the services that run it, the garden structures, or built-in light?"
KEY=[
"1. Is it fitted for cooking, washing up or keeping food and wine cold in the kitchen? → Kitchen",
"2. Is it a bath, basin, toilet, shower, sauna, steam room or hot tub? → Bath & wellness",
"3. Is it a fire, stove, surround, ceiling fan or built-in sound or screen for a living room? → Living & entertainment",
"4. Is it a door, window, staircase, lift, floor or fitted wardrobe forming the shell or the way through it? → Structure & circulation",
"5. Does it carry or control heat, air, water, power or information (boiler, radiator, heat pump, filter, socket, panel, thermostat)? → Home systems",
"6. Is it a pool, deck, pergola, outdoor kitchen, garden building or garage fixed outside? → Outdoor & grounds",
"7. Is it a light fitting set into the structure (downlight, track, under-cabinet, step or cove light)? → Built-in lighting",
"<i>Precedence: a stove that heats the room is Living (step 3) before Home systems (step 5); a built-in light is step 7 even in a kitchen or bathroom; freestanding appliances, loose furniture and portable heaters are not fixtures (see Kitchen & Dining, Portable Climate & Air).</i>"]
DEPT={
"Kitchen":("Fitted kitchen units, surfaces, sinks and built-in appliances; freestanding appliances and cookware → Kitchen & Dining (B5), fitted wine rooms stay here.","What does the fitting do in the kitchen: hold and surface the work area, cook, or keep food and wine cold?"),
"Bath & wellness":("Fixed bathroom fittings, saunas, steam rooms and hot tubs; loose towels and bath mats → Home textiles, whole-house water filters → Home systems.","Which bathing job does it do: soaking and showering, basin and toilet, drying and support, sweating in heat, or soaking in a tub?"),
"Living & entertainment":("Fixed heat, air and sound features of living rooms; portable heaters and fans → Portable Climate & Air (B7), freestanding speakers → Audio & Video.","What does it give the room: a fire to sit by, moving air, sound or a picture?"),
"Structure & circulation":("Doors, windows, stairs, lifts, floors and fitted storage that form the shell of the home; locks → B8, raw boards and timber → Building Materials (C8).","Which part of the shell is it: an opening, a way between floors, the floor itself, or built-in storage?"),
"Home systems":("Plant and controls that carry heat, air, water, power or information through a home; portable appliances → Portable Climate & Air (B7), burglar alarms are also listed in Home Safety & Security (B8).","What does the system carry or control: heat, cooling, hot water, clean water, air, mains power, solar power, or information?"),
"Outdoor & grounds":("Structures fixed in a garden or plot: pools, outdoor rooms, decks, buildings and garages; movable furniture and barbecues → Garden & Grounds (C2).","What is the structure for: swimming, sitting out, standing on, working or storing in, or sheltering vehicles?"),
"Built-in lighting":("Light fittings set into the structure of a room or garden; lamps, pendants and strip lights → Lighting (B3).","Where in the structure is the light set: ceiling, rail, under a cabinet, low on a step, or in a cove?"),
}
SH={ # shelf: (t, ax)
"Units, worktops & sinks":("Cabinets, work surfaces and the water fittings set in them: a fitted kitchen, a worktop, a sink, a tap; appliances → Cooking & extraction.","kinds from the whole kitchen down to its parts: cabinets, surface, sink, tap, disposal"),
"Cooking & extraction":("Built-in and range cookers, ovens, hobs and hoods that heat and vent food; loose cookers and microwaves → Kitchen & Dining (B5).","kinds by how food is heated: whole range cooker, oven, hob, then extraction and extras"),
"Cold storage & wine":("Built-in fridges and wine storage, from a cabinet under the worktop to a cellar room; loose fridges → Kitchen & Dining (B5).","kinds by size: cabinet, column, room"),
"Baths & showers":("Fixed tubs and shower fittings, from the bath to the tray, screen and filter; hot tubs → Hot tubs & plunge pools.","kinds from soaking to showering: bath, shower valve and head, enclosure, tray, wall panel, filter"),
"Basins, toilets & taps":("Fittings for washing hands and using the toilet: basins, vanity units, taps, toilets, bidets and shower toilets; baths → Baths & showers.","kinds by use: basin and storage, tap, toilet, wash after the toilet"),
"Bathroom comfort & safety":("Fixed extras that dry, warm or steady you in a bathroom: towel rails, laundry dryers and grab bars; a radiator for rooms → Heating & radiators.","kinds by job: warming and drying, then support"),
"Saunas & steam rooms":("Rooms and cabins heated for sweat bathing in dry heat or steam; a hot tub → Hot tubs & plunge pools.","kinds from the room to its heater: cabin, heater, portable, steam"),
"Hot tubs & plunge pools":("Heated or chilled tubs for soaking: hard-shell spas, inflatable tubs, wood-fired tubs, swim spas and cold plunge tubs; a swimming pool → Outdoor & grounds.","kinds by how the water is kept warm or cold: heated shell, inflatable, wood fire, swim current, chiller"),
"Fireplaces & stoves":("Fixed fires and stoves that heat a room, with their surrounds; a portable heater → B7.","kinds by how the fire is housed: closed stove, heat store, built-in fire, flueless, then the surround"),
"Ceiling fans & built-in media":("Features fitted into ceilings and walls for air, sound and picture: ceiling fans, in-wall speakers, TV lifts and cinema rooms.","kinds by what they give the room: air, sound, picture, whole room"),
"Doors & windows":("Openings in the shell: doors, windows, roof windows and garage doors, with guards; locks → B8.","kinds from the main entrance to the roof: door, window, roof window, garage door, guard"),
"Stairs & lifts":("Fixed ways between floors, with or without a motor: staircases, stairlifts and home lifts.","kinds by how you climb: steps, chair on a rail, lift"),
"Flooring":("Laid floor coverings that stay in the house: wood, laminate and vinyl; rugs and carpet → Home textiles.","kinds by surface layer: real wood, printed laminate, vinyl"),
"Fitted storage":("Storage built to the room: wardrobes and dressing rooms; kitchen units → Units, worktops & sinks.",None),
"Heating & radiators":("Plant and emitters that heat rooms from a central source: boilers, furnaces, radiators and underfloor heating.","kinds from heat source to emitter: boiler, furnace, storage heater, then radiators, then floor"),
"Heat pumps & air conditioning":("Refrigerant-cycle plant that heats or cools: split air conditioners, ducted systems and heat pumps; portable air conditioners → B7.","kinds by where the heat goes: air to room, air to ducts, air to water, ground to water"),
"Hot water":("Plant that heats the water for taps and showers: storage, tankless, cylinder, heat-pump and solar heaters.","kinds by how water is heated: tank, on demand, indirect cylinder, immersion, heat pump, point of use, sun"),
"Water treatment":("Units that soften, filter or disinfect the water supply; jugs and tap filters → Kitchen & Dining (B5).","kinds by what they do to the water: soften, filter, purify, disinfect, then consumables"),
"Ventilation & central vacuum":("Fans and ducted systems that move air or dust through a home; portable dehumidifiers and cleaners → B7, B6.","kinds by what is moved: fresh air, stale air, moisture, dust"),
"Switches, sockets & wiring":("Wall fittings and boards that carry mains power to rooms: switches, sockets, ceiling roses and consumer units.","kinds from the user end to the board: switch, socket, ceiling rose, consumer unit, breaker"),
"Solar & home energy":("Equipment that generates, stores or converts power for a home: panels, kits, batteries, inverters and wind turbines.","kinds from source to use: generate, kit, store, convert, supporting parts"),
"Smart home & controls":("Systems that sense and command a home: whole-home controllers, lighting and shade control, thermostats, alarms and entry phones.","kinds from the whole system to single devices: controller, lighting, shades, climate, energy, security, entry"),
"Pools & water edges":("Fixed swimming pools and jetties built at a plot's water; above-ground pools → Garden & Grounds (C2).","kinds by water: pool in the ground, structure over open water"),
"Outdoor rooms & kitchens":("Open-sided roofed structures and fitted cooking areas for sitting and eating outside; pop-up gazebos → E2.","kinds from open frame to full kitchen: pergola, gazebo, patio cover, outdoor kitchen"),
"Decks & paving":("Laid surfaces to stand and sit on outside: raised decking and paved patios.","kinds by build: raised timber, laid paving"),
"Garden buildings":("Enclosed outbuildings a person can enter: sheds, summerhouses, offices, cabins, huts, workshops and container rooms; greenhouses → Garden & Grounds (C2).","kinds by use: storage, sitting, working, living, social, making"),
"Garages & shelters":("Buildings and roofs for vehicles and boats: garages, carports and boathouses.","kinds by what is kept: car under cover, car enclosed, boat"),
"Built-in lighting":("Light fittings fixed into ceilings, cabinets, steps and coves, which light a space without a lamp; lamps and pendants → Lighting (B3).","kinds by where the fitting is set: ceiling, rail, under a cabinet, step or plinth, cove"),
}
